    "type": "tipe",
    "Software Details": "Detail Perangkat Lunak",
    "Your employees are your business’s greatest assets. Whether you employ 5, 50, or 500 people, with HRMGo, you can manage all employee matters. From hiring to performance and salaries - everything under one roof. Customizable, versatile, and easy-to-use complete HRM system.": "Karyawan Anda adalah aset terbesar bisnis Anda. Kelola seluruh urusan karyawan dari perekrutan hingga penggajian secara terpusat.",
    "/Month": "/Bulan",
    "/Year": "/Tahun",
    "Buy Now": "Beli Sekarang",
    "View Live Demo": "Lihat Demo Langsung",
    "The": "Sistem",
    "Complete": "Selesai",
    "HRM System Your Business Needs…": "Sistem SDM yang Dibutuhkan Bisnis Anda…",
    "With HRMGo, you can manage key employee matters, recruit new candidates, boost employee productivity, and pay your employees for their hard work - Without stress, all from one place. Whether youre a consultant, small business owner, or large corporation - the system is designed for everyone.": "Kelola data karyawan, rekrut kandidat baru, tingkatkan produktivitas, dan lakukan penggajian dengan mudah dari satu lokasi.",
    "Manage Your HR Like a Boss": "Kelola Your HR Like a Boss",
    "This comprehensive feature facilitates the activities of HR. It is easy to maintain a record of promotions, transfers, work trips, terminations, warnings, and other important aspects of HR.": "Fitur komprehensif ini mempermudah pencatatan promosi, mutasi, perjalanan dinas, pemberhentian, peringatan, dan aspek SDM lainnya.",
    "Manage Key Employee Matters Easily": "Kelola Key Employee Matters Easily",
    "Create a profile for every employee and track their key information, including position, salary, and career progress. Update and change their information in just a few clicks. Track employee contract status. Transfer them to different departments, branches, or terminate the contract if needed.": "Buat a profile for every employee and track their key information, including position, salary, and career progress. Update and change their information in just a few clicks. Track employee contract status. Transfer them to different departments, branches, or terminate the contract if needed.",
    "Recruit New Candidates and Grow Your Team": "Rekrut Kandidat Baru dan Kembangkan Tim Anda",
    "Speed up your hiring process. Use built-in hiring features to create and manage new job openings and fill your open positions faster. Collect and manage applications from start to finish. Easily compare candidates and pick the best one for the job.": "Percepat proses rekrutmen. Gunakan fitur bawaan untuk membuat lowongan kerja, mengumpulkan lamaran, dan memilih kandidat terbaik.",
    "Pay Your Employees for their Hard Work": "Bayar Karyawan Anda atas Kerja Keras Mereka",
    "Manage payroll in just a few clicks. Calculate salaries, schedule deposits, and make sure your employees get paid on time. Keep data of all workforce costs, transfers, deposits, and other employee-related transactions for future reference.": "Kelola payroll in just a few clicks. Calculate salaries, schedule deposits, and make sure your employees get paid on time. Keep data of all workforce costs, transfers, deposits, and other employee-related transactions for future reference.",
    "Everything You Need For a Successful HRM - In One Place": "Semua yang Anda Butuhkan untuk Manajemen SDM Sukses - di Satu Tempat",
    "This feature makes it easier for a company to maintain a record of an employee’s personal, company, and Bank details along with their essential documentation. Employees could view and manage their profiles.": "Memudahkan perusahaan menyimpan data pribadi, profil, dan perbankan karyawan secara rapi dan aman.",
    "Say Goodbye To Spending Thousands Of Dollars On Hiring HR Managers.": "Kelola SDM Lebih Efisien Tanpa Biaya Konsultan yang Mahal.",
    "Need to fill an open position? Just create a new job opening in HRM and manage the process from start to finish. With HRM, recruit new candidates faster and save time on hiring managers. Create a job opening, collect and manage applications, create a candidate pipeline, and handle interviews.": "Buka lowongan pekerjaan dan kelola seluruh alur rekrutmen dari awal hingga akhir dengan mudah.",
    "Help Your Employees Become More Productive": "Bantu Karyawan Anda Menjadi Lebih Produktif",
    "Empower employee growth. Schedule skills training, track expenses, and watch your employees become better at their work. Boost employee productivity with custom KPIs. Track employee performance, share feedback, and help them reach company targets.": "Tingkatkan pertumbuhan karyawan dengan pelatihan, pemantauan kinerja, dan penetapan target perusahaan yang jelas.",
    "Manage Payroll in Just a Few Clicks": "Kelola Payroll in Just a Few Clicks",
    "Pay your employees for their hard work. Keep data of all workforce costs, transfers, deposits, and other employee-related transactions for future reference. Track employee attendance and overtime to ensure they always receive fair compensation for their work.": "Bayar gaji karyawan secara akurat, catat presensi, dan kelola lembur dengan transparan.",
    "Manage Payroll Effortlessly": "Kelola Payroll Effortlessly",
    "You can generate monthly payslips and make bulk payments through easy clicks. You could also change the status of the payslip with an easy CTA. An employee could view the breakdown of their salary components.": "Buat slip gaji bulanan dan lakukan pembayaran massal hanya dengan beberapa klik.",
    "Use built-in hiring features to create and manage new job openings and fill your open positions faster. Schedule interviews, create interview questions and assign interviewers in just a few clicks.": "Gunakan fitur rekrutmen bawaan untuk mengelola lowongan pekerjaan dan wawancara kerja secara cepat.",
    "Why choose dedicated modules": "Mengapa memilih modul khusus",
    "for your business?": "untuk bisnis Anda?",
    "With Dash, you can conveniently manage all your business functions from a single location": "Dengan sistem ini, Anda dapat mengelola semua fungsi bisnis Anda dengan mudah dari satu tempat",
    "Empower Your Workforce with DASH": "Tingkatkan Kinerja Tenaga Kerja Anda",
    "Access over Premium Add-ons for Accounting, HR, Payments, Leads, Communication, Management, and more, all in one place!": "Akses Add-on Premium untuk Akuntansi, SDM, Pembayaran, Prospek, Komunikasi, Manajemen, dan lainnya di satu tempat!",
